Z||000003||Dragon||10-15-2001||12:17 AM||||In defense of Denny Payton to the best of my knowledge his stuff is not a copy.  His Rocker panels are not like the IRM panels, the 355 nose is of his own design.  The Upper and lower scoops are made by Webb's Creative Laminations, Rockledge Florida and sold by Denny.  The upper scoops were the first on the market with or without windows.  <P>------------------<BR>Dragon<BR> <IMG SRC="http://SpaceCoastFieros.com/dragonfamily.jpg"> <BR>   Space Coast Fieros||||reg||1
