Z||000025||Philphine||10-16-2001||11:57 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Jaygee79:<BR><B>I have no opinion on the subject (actually I do but I'm not here to state that).  I just wanted to say that I find it sort of interesting that there weren't all these "free market" comments in the other post.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>i didn't comment in the other thread because i wasn't sure how guilty i was myself. i saw rodneys rear hatch lift in a fiero mag long ago and thought "hmm...i can do that", and did. i didn't go into business with it but i have made another for my self recently, will probaly make one for my indy and as part of a do it yourself thread i mentioned what i had done. i admitted it wasn't as nice but for the cost it seemed like a good idea worth doing and sharing.<P>is that wrong?<P>------------------<BR>Phil T.<P>start where you are,<BR>use what you have,<BR>do what you can.||||reg||1
